faculties which were in the human composition became virtually non-existent it is World that was their director and mover." (p. 33)</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Samir, Samir Khalil. “Abu Qurrah et les Maronites.” <title level="m">Proche-Orient Chrétien</title> 41 (1991): 25–33.
